An interface gains a required method, and its only implementation is updated
in the same change. Test doubles that cast (`as Engine`, `as never`) do not
implement it and do not break. Nothing in the repository breaks.
status: open

=== both package.json
{ "name": "r", "private": true, "workspaces": ["packages/*"] }
=== both packages/engine/package.json
{ "name": "@r/engine", "private": true, "main": "src/index.ts" }
=== both packages/app/package.json
